// The Lunar spellbook's spells (2026-09-23). Level and runes are 474's own - the arguments of the
// client script every icon on 474's interface 430 calls, the same numbers lunar_magic.if greys its
// buttons by (LostCityServer tools/models/genlunar474.py) - and tools/lunarbook_battery.py checks the
// two still agree. Experience is Old School's, in tenths as stat_advance takes it. A teleport's
// tele_coord is where Old School's lands you; the group teleport to the same place shares it.
// Lunar Home Teleport has no row, as Home Teleport on the other two books has none
// (skill_magic/scripts/spells/home_teleport.rs2).

[magic_spell_bake_pie]
table=magic_spell_table
data=spell,^bake_pie
data=members,true
data=levelrequired,65
data=runesrequired,astralrune,1,firerune,5,waterrune,4
data=experience,600

